          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I realized millions of urban Indian families yearn for this exact cultural connectedness. That is why I left the corporate world to create Antakshari.</p><p>We are India’s first festival-led, regional craft-inspired celebration wear for modern families. We solve a real urban problem: the lack of easy access to authentic, comfortable, and high-quality traditional attire for the entire family; how do we get our younger generation to stay connected with our cultural roots. We offer uncompromising commitment to festive celebration through comfort, convenience, and genuine cultural storytelling.</p><p>Antakshari delivers rooted yet modern aesthetics that turn dressing up into joyful, stress-free family moments. Because you shouldn't have to choose between a modern life and a traditional soul. Wear your story, embrace your roots, and let’s celebrate together. </p>",
